    "workload": "generate 8 arrays of 20000 LCG draws over a 25000-wide range once (dense enough that runs actually form, so the inner walk does real work), then 150 punches of the full O(n) set pass -- build the set, then from each run-start walk forward while present. Sink = sum of the longest-run lengths. NOTE: C hand-rolls an open-addressing hash set rather than the far faster direct-address bitset the bounded value range would allow, so the data structure matches the other four.",
